stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received : raw chunk retrieved
    Received --> Auditing : verification active
    Auditing --> Validated : trust score >= 0.80
    Auditing --> RequiresReview : warnings raised
    Auditing --> Rejected : structural failures
    
    Validated --> [*]
    RequiresReview --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
